    "hero-ingredient-cards": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "ingredient-card-1": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Coconut_Oil_Extract.webp",
            "title": "Saponified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil",
            "title_size": "medium",
            "text": "<p><em>The base.<\/em> Cold-pressed virgin coconut oil reacted with potassium hydroxide produces soap molecules and naturally occurring glycerin — the entire cleansing system, with no added surfactants. Coconut-based soap is naturally high in lauric and capric acid soap chains, which lather well and lift oil and dirt without stripping the skin's lipid layer the way SLS does.<\/p>",
            "button_label": ""
          }
        },
        "ingredient-card-2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Spring_Water.webp",
            "title": "Built for the Foaming Dispenser",
            "title_size": "medium",
            "text": "<p><em>Diluted, not weakened.<\/em> The same coconut-oil saponification as the bar — diluted to foaming-pump consistency and designed for the foaming dispenser, not a standard pump. The pump aerates a small amount into a generous lather, which means less product per wash than conventional pump soap. A regular pump will dispense it as a runny liquid and waste most of it.<\/p>",
            "button_label": ""
          }
        },
        "ingredient-card-3": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Wax.webp",
            "title": "Variation Essential Oils",
            "title_size": "medium",
            "text": "<p><em>Scent without synthetic fragrance.<\/em> Each variation has a different blend of organic essential oils, named individually on the back panel — never a \"fragrance\" umbrella hiding undisclosed compounds. Orange Zest is orange, bergamot, spearmint, lemon, and grapefruit oils. Coconut Breeze is organic coconut oil extract. Calming Lavender is lavender oil. Pure Unscented has no oils added — just the natural light scent of saponified coconut oil.<\/p>",
            "button_label": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ingredient-card-1",
        "ingredient-card-2",
        "ingredient-card-3"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "heading": "One base. Three things to know.",
