    "founder-block": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "founder-heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "From The Founder",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "founder-body": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When we started reading the back panels of foaming hand soaps marketed to families, we kept finding the same surfactant cocktails under a plant on the front label. We wanted a soap our kids could use a dozen times a day without their hands cracking by November.<\/p><p>One ingredient saponified, diluted for the foaming dispenser, scented with named essential oils or nothing at all. That's the whole formula.<\/p><p>— Sean Fillmore<\/p>",
            "text_size": "typeset",
            "secondary_color": false
